1. Introduction
Purpose

This document provides technical documentation for the key DAX measures used in the Executive Sales Dashboard.

The measures were designed to transform raw transactional sales data into meaningful business insights through executive KPIs, time intelligence calculations, dynamic report elements, and conditional formatting.

Rather than focusing only on calculations, the measures support interactive analysis and enable business users to monitor sales performance, profitability, growth trends, and regional performance efficiently.


2. Measure Categories

The dashboard measures are organized into the following functional categories.

| Category           | Purpose                                           |
| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |
| Core KPIs          | Calculate executive business metrics              |
| Time Intelligence  | Compare business performance across time          |
| Dynamic Reporting  | Create interactive report titles and summaries    |
| Executive Insights | Generate automated business insight text          |
| KPI Indicators     | Drive conditional formatting and trend indicators |
| Slicer Measures    | Display current report selections                 |


